<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 75% of normal in August to September and 73% of normal in November to December. January to February 2026 came in at 43% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 22994 had its driest year in 1987 at 64%.</p>"}
